.MARINE...
(Tonight through next Wednesday)
Issued at 312 PM PST Fri Nov 27 2026

North breezes tonight and Saturday morning become southerly
Saturday afternoon out ahead of the next impactful system that
will bring increased rain chances beginning late Saturday night
and continue through Tuesday with a slight chance of thunderstorms
across our northern waters Sunday afternoon and evening. Expect
moderate to rough seas in excess of 15 feet and developing long
period swell over 15 seconds Tuesday and Wednesday.

